<title>UK: Oct Gullfaks crude loading down 10 at 10 cargoes.</title>
<headline>Oct Gullfaks crude loading down 10 at 10 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Gullfaks crude system is scheduled to load 10 cargoes in October, down 10 cargoes from the original September programme because of extensive scheduled maintenance, traders said.  </p>
<p>The much lower loading programme was expected because maintenance at the system which had originally been scheduled for August was postponed until October 11-26.</p>
<p>Gullfaks crude loads offshore in 855,000-barrel cargoes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
